{
 "tickets": [
  {
   "body": "Hello, I am so sorry to bother you with this, but I am having some trouble finishing up my controlled substance prescribing setup. I completed my identity verification steps earlier, but now every time I try to use my authentication token to sign a test script, the system gives me an error code and won't let me finalize it. I have tried restarting my browser and re-entering the token code several times, but it keeps failing. Could you please point me in the right direction so I can get this sorted out? Thanks so much.",
   "id": "gen-281",
   "subject": "Apologies for reaching out - token authentication failing during controlled substance setup"
  },
  {
   "id": "gen-282",
   "subject": "Password reset and security policy configuration",
   "body": "Hello support, I need to reset my login password as it is about to expire. Also, as the sole administrator for my practice, I would like to know how to configure our security settings to enforce stricter password complexity rules for future logins. Please let me know the steps when you have a moment."
  },
  {
   "body": "Hi there, I am really scratching my head over this and hope you can help. I am trying to attach some outside paper lab reports and scanned PDF imaging files to patient charts at the front desk, but something weird is happening. Whenever I try to upload documents that are a bit larger in size, the system either hangs indefinitely or gives me a generic error message instead of saving the file to the correct chart. I tried compressing one of the PDFs to make it smaller, but it still wouldn't go through. Am I clicking the wrong button, or is there a specific file size limit I am missing here?",
   "id": "gen-283",
   "subject": "Confused about uploading larger paper lab report files and attachments"
  },
  {
   "body": "We need assistance with an electronic prescription transmission failure due to what appears to be an outdated pharmacy record in the system directory. Please advise.",
   "id": "gen-284",
   "subject": "E-prescription transmission error"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hi, I'm looking over our latest subscription invoice and I'm a bit confused because it looks like we were billed twice for this month. We are a small practice and only have the essentials tier, so this duplicate charge doesn't seem right. Could someone look into this and refund the extra amount to our account?",
   "id": "gen-285",
   "subject": "Confused about duplicate charge on monthly invoice"
  },
  {
   "body": "Medication for a patient went to the wrong pharmacy because the directory data was outdated. Please correct this immediately.",
   "id": "gen-286",
   "subject": "Prescription sent to incorrect pharmacy"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, I am so sorry to bother you, but we ran into a bit of a mix-up with a patient's medication today. The prescription was accidentally transmitted to a pharmacy location that closed down last month instead of their preferred active location. Could you please help us figure out how to update their favorites list properly so this doesn't happen again?",
   "id": "gen-287",
   "subject": "Apologies - prescription sent to closed pharmacy location"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello support, I am really confused about what is happening with our diagnostic feeds. Over the past couple of days, it seems like our direct electronic lab interface connections have just stopped working correctly. We are not seeing incoming results populate automatically for our patients anymore, and I am not sure where to look to see if a connection dropped. I checked our main integration dashboard, but everything looks green, yet no new data is coming through. Could someone please help me figure out how to troubleshoot this missing feed issue?",
   "id": "gen-288",
   "subject": "Confused about missing lab feed connections and results"
  },
  {
   "body": "Dear support team, our clinic is currently experiencing an issue where incoming electronic lab results have stopped populating automatically through our direct interface connection. Please investigate the drop in our data feed and advise on what steps are required to restore normal integration functionality.",
   "id": "gen-289",
   "subject": "Troubleshooting electronic lab interface connection drops"
  },
  {
   "body": "I am having endless trouble trying to finish setting up my controlled substance prescribing credentials. Every single time I enter my security token during the final signing step, the software rejects it and loops me back to the beginning. I've wasted an hour on this already. Please fix whatever is blocking my token authentication.",
   "id": "gen-290",
   "subject": "Token authentication failing during controlled substance setup"
  }
 ]
}
